@node Top
@top mplapack-interop

This manual documents the @code{mplapack-interop} Octave package. It provides
a dense, two-dimensional @code{mp} value with MPFR real storage and MPC
complex storage. MPLAPACK is used for the supported dense linear-algebra
drivers; other operations use package-owned MPFR/MPC algorithms.

The current development line is @code{0.5.0-dev}. T00--T14 is accepted.
MPLAPACK 3.0.1 is documented as a release candidate until its upstream
release process is complete.

